      "en": "This is my father Adnan",
      "au": "01_10_01_06.mp3",
      "notes": "هَذَا (this M) + وَالِدِي (my father). Proper noun عَدْنَانُ takes a single damma."
    },
    {
      "ar": "وَهُوَ مُهَنْدِسٌ",
